{
  "id": "1SA.20",
  "number": "20",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Samweli 20",
  "verseCount": 42,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yonatan ghaweat Dawdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gamng'aw Dawdi aba Nayoti mida Rama, ak ghwaan madeeda Yonatan ak gwayeesha, “Aniini neada ea neasinyi naaha? Giidiinyeandeanyu naaha? Ak riing'eedeanyu ea aneeda aba madeeda gweanu, ea eeyi bwak ea gagasa eaweegeasu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha niny siidida, “Niheawa ASEETA gideaba gaymeawa. Ng'ula, bwaabwa iissa ea maygwasin gida eara aahaw nea marukunean; abeeda ghwasaan inyas gayghafunyanaan bwaabwa ng'asheanji? Manda masnu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Dawdi nea gwayeesha, “Gweanu ghwanal gida ibwariiydanaan; ak gwayeena, ‘Adaghwanal Yonatan ng'asheanji, aba gideaba gajiidu ghwanyareas.’ Nea aba huumwa, aba gidabiideata NG'UTAMIIDA ea gidabiideata gurooroadaang'u, aniini ea miyeeda gwanda dageascheedeanya geeshagi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwalamda Yonatan ak gwayeesha Dawdi, “Ng'asheanda wassean irugu, gaydasineey.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Dawdi Yonatan, “Ng'ula, numuji gwanda ghweelmeeda ng'ushiinda sheeda, ak ea mayghwashiy giimbuucheeda sugoocheanda; ak gaydeambuuchi sugoocheanda; asi nung'waada dawa, ak ghaafunyi geaw aba jeeda madamnyeanda ea ghwahita shing'adeeda eaweeteaba samwagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimwadaahan gweanu nea geambuucheewi, aba gidarukuta, ‘Giyeeshi geamuscheey dalamwajaada dawa ghoah aba Betlehemeeda was mujiineadaanyi; aba gideaba gwanda lukghumeeda, gweayda aba badayda fuga ghaheanya sean.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama ayi, ‘Ghwahit!’ Abeeda ghwahit aba heeda siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda; ama nyareas, abeeda ginali gideaba gagasa gwasawanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi sisiina siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda ng'asheega miyaas, aba gideaba niyeadu siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda jeeda neajeadaang'u ghaydit sea ang'iing'i. Ama deepa gwanda heedeanyu giidiinyeanda, abeeda ginuuschean ang'iing'i; aba gideaba ghwasaan inyas gajaadaan heeda gweanu eenuusan?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Yonatan ak gwayeesha, “Gagasa gwasheagiidaneey ng'asheanji! Inyeeda ghaanali gideaba gagasa gwasin bwaabwa ng'asheanda muy aba badaydaang'u, neada gwachi ea maydarukuneeyi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Dawdi Yonatan, “Gaygwarukunean ng'eaha gideaba gweanu iissa ghwasha ghuutaang'u nea ghwanyareas?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Badiida gida jea eaweedida Dawdi aba heeda Sawli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda Yonatan ak gwayeesha Dawdi, “Beeni, eeweaya madamnyeanda.” Hean gaweay duwaawi jeeda madamnyeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yonatan Dawdi, “NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA Israeli gagasa ghoah muushoocheanda! Damanda jea danyaasha numuji damanda uurji nih, ghana eaweeteaba samwagu, ng'ula, iideepa gwanda ng'asheanda miy haguuw Dawdi, abeeda gwachi ea maydeaneey iita ak gearukuneey ng'asheanji? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwaabwa iigasa gideaba gaygwasawanyi, abeeda gagasa ghwalasan NG'UTAMIIDA ak ghaameayi iimearukuneey iita ak ghaanung' una nea gibea seayu. Gagasa mideayeata NG'UTAMIIDA gida mideaydooscheata sea bwaabwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu dawoos majeek, giihiimnaan bariinyeega huumwa bea NG'UTAMIIDA, ak abeeda ea mwaameawi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ea adigeandi bariinyeagaagu aba gheenyu damanda manda muudeanooda. Aba damanda jea gooheeleewa NG'UTAMIIDA giliwas sih was weajoodiga Dawdi aba badayda ng'eanyiida, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gidabal ea measaja gheawunga Yonatan aba jeeda gheeh Dawdi. Ak gidabal ghawalda NG'UTAMIIDA mureandooda aba badahuuka weajoodiga Dawdi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwanung' Yonatan ghwaak Dawdi habeawooda gicha aba gidabwariiyda niny; aba gideaba ghabwariiy niny gidabwariiyda gurooroadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Yonatan niny, “Numuji ng'ushiinda sheeda; iimindani hiji gajeanal, aba gideaba hoorgeadaang'u maygwanda sih. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak abeeda askweardeaba samwagu gajeanal gideaba mindani hiji; asi una heeda ifuysi geaw damanda jea ghwahina ng'asheanda, ak gifuysi geaw murdeeda lagheanga siimughuush. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydajaksa geat samwagu murdeeda, gawuurji gileafuchi gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ging'ulayi, gaydeajeakta siideanyu bea gadiyeeda nea geayeeshi, ‘Una, ak gigasayi geatka.’ Ama iyeeshi siideanyu bea gadiyeeda, ‘Ng'ula, geatka gwanda hiji bea murdeadaang'uun, geani,’ ak abeeda guwuni nea aba gidabiideata NG'UTAMIIDA gaybeaha seayu nea maygwanda washta jea nyasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama eayeeshi gheareemaneeda, ‘Ng'ula, geatka gwanda badaydaang'u,’ abeeda guwi; aba gideaba goojeaktaneey NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba badaydeaba ng'asheandida ghayi sirugu, aniini ea ang'iing'iin, ng'ula, NG'UTAMIIDA gwanda dageascheedeanyu ea daang'u damanda manda muudeanooda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghafuy geaw Dawdi aba madamnyeanda; amadu nea geeng'usha sheeda, goopteada sugoocheanda gweagiischi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goopteada sugoocheanda aba badayda hoorgeadaanyi, gawuurji gideaba eawoojisu, aba badayda hoorgeeda mida guumda ghamarda; ak goopteada Yonatan nea gang'ula geat, ak goopteada Abna aba murdeeda Sawli, nea hoorgeeda Dawdi ea manda sih. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadu ea marukuna Sawli gil askweardida; aba gideaba gwayi, “Gwanda ng'asheanda niibussa niny; niny mii doabiiwaat.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama eaweeteaba iyeenya, sakteayda nea ning'ata ng'ushiinda sheeda, ea manda sih hoorgeeda Dawdi. Ghwalamda Sawli ak gwayeesha Yonatan was orjeedaanyi, “Ghwasaan anda orjeeda Yese mii ghwaan agiischooda heeta ea ghamneawa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha Yonatan ak gwayeesha Sawli, “Gamusan Dawdi daadaw beata jea gawa Betlehemu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea gwayeesha, ‘Eaniyean nung' dawa; aba gideaba fuga ghaheanya gwasin ghweelmeeda lukghumajeega aba jeeda mujiini, ak gaguuru orjeeda giyeanya nea gagasa dawa hoowa.’ Asi ghamneawa, iinaanyaschi alooheeda aba madeeda gheanyangaagu, goonean beata, dadaah orjoogiyya. Nih gidamwahinana hiji goombuuchi sea sugoocheanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwaheedu nyarasta Sawli aba badayda Yonatan, ak gwayeesha niny, “Ea orjeeda was deambiilaneeda, bea gatmooda sadaat, neada aniini ea mwaanali gideaba niloadi orjeeda Yese ak giibwaaspwaasi geaw aba dawiishnata geamadu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba damanda duugwandeewa ng'eanyiida orjeeda Yese, adea ang'iing'i ghana ea sugoocheanduumeadaang'u gil aba ng'eang'i. Asi una ak giyeadu heedeanyu, aba gideaba aba huumwa gayghami.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Yonatan ghweandaanyi was Sawli, “Ghwasaan inyas gajeenuus? Neada eanisin naaha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwajakta Sawli ng'utaanyi ghang'ut niny; gwajeeng'u Yonatan gideaba gagasa ghwaan gideaba gayghabwar Dawdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat Yonatan aba heeda agiischooda nea ninyareas muuchi ak nea mwaaga gil eaweeteaba iyeenya bea sheeda, aba gideaba gagiisan aba badayda Dawdi, aba gideaba niing'eawi ghwaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu gawa Yonatan jeeda madamnyeanda gwanyeaschi sea Dawdi nea goodeayi sea orjeeda mwanang'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha baleandaanyi, “Fwaja ak gigasayi geatka eahisti.” Damanda fwaja baleanda, goomaseaw geacheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwahita baleanda heeda geacheeda jakta Yonatan, gaguursa Yonatan orjeeda nea gwayeesha, “Neada geacheeda ea mudugwanda madeadaang'u?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaguurda Yonatan aba geeshta baleanda nea gwayeesha, “Lamwaja, halni geaw, adishing'di.” Ghoawaam baleanda Yonatan geatka, ak gabiigu heeda siidaanyi haw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda baleanda mwanala eara gil; geaghus Yonatan sea Dawdi gea nal ng'asheanji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoadaw Yonatan dabitaanyi jeaptaanyi, ak gwayeesha niny, “Una ak giyaadi saawa mujiini.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea gawa baleanda, ghang'eat Dawdi aba murdeeda lagheanga siimughuush ak ghabwada jih ng'eanyi, ak gwatkuy niba samwagu; ak gaba siisi sam gheatba nuut, ak gaba siisi ayeawusa nuut, ak gagiisan Dawdi ea ghoadaraam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Yonatan Dawdi, “Una nea gibea hoyyoo, ‘ak gaygwasikteawa NG'UTAMIIDA gideaba ang'iing'i ea aniini, ea jeacheangaagu ea geasu, gayghoang'waay neajeeda ghaydit damanda manda muudeanooda.’” Ghang'eat Dawdi gawa, ak ghang'eat Yonatan gawa mujiini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
